cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this standard or the reference kit, please cite it as below."
title: "Practice Data Platform Standard, Open Edition"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-18
authors:
  - family-names: Erkinov
    given-names: Firdavs
    affiliation: Firdavsystems LLC
repository-code: "https://github.com/Firdavsystems-llc/practice-data-standard"
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A written standard and reference kit for data platforms at independent
  medical practices of fewer than 20 clinicians: conformed data
  definitions, a measure catalogue, data-quality tests with thresholds,
  a delivery and operating method, and assessment baselines, with a
  synthetic-data reference implementation on Microsoft Fabric. Open
  edition of the Firdavsystems LLC Practice Data Platform Reference
  Architecture and Implementation Package v1.1.
keywords:
  - healthcare data
  - medical practice
  - revenue cycle
  - data quality
  - Microsoft Fabric
  - Power BI
  - synthetic data
